# Prisma - Migrations (DEBATE: Some commit, some don't)
# Option A: Commit migrations (RECOMMENDED for team projects)
# Do NOT ignore these:
# prisma/migrations/**/*.sql
# !prisma/migrations/**/migration_lock.toml

# Option B: Ignore all migrations (if you regenerate them)
prisma/migrations/
!prisma/migrations/migration_lock.toml

